The sequence is strongly supported as an RlmN-family radical-SAM methyltransferase: it has the RlmN N-terminal domain, a Radical_SAM domain, and near-full-length homologs with curated EC 2.1.1.192 annotations. I will now record the catalytic assignment and reaction evidence.

